{"2893930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "STRIKEOUT", "steam_appid": 2893930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's the worst day of Michael Softwindow's life.</strong> <br><i>He has to touch grass.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/d9627e0612010d0949b46ce90962d957.poster.avif?t=1780790509\" width=238 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/d9627e0612010d0949b46ce90962d957.webm?t=1780790509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/d9627e0612010d0949b46ce90962d957.mp4?t=1780790509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After costing his team last year's championship, Michael Softwindows would rather stay in bed forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, his baseball gear has mysteriously vanished, and finding it means venturing into the strange worlds hidden throughout his room. He gathers his trusty talking baseball bat and goes on a quest to retrieve his friends... <i>If they can even call him a friend.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>underground civilizations</strong>, the world of <strong>forgotten drawings</strong>, <strong>way too big closets</strong>, and his <strong>bad rpg games he made as a kid</strong>...? All in the entirety of his bedroom?! Uncover the history of Michael's past and the tragic events that unfolded that turned him into a rude, cold, irony-poisoned jerk... and if it's too late for redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He would really rather go back to sleep, but he must confront the dastardly <strong>DARK TROPHIOUS</strong> and the mysterious <strong>Coach</strong> to rescue his stolen gear and face the consequences of everything he's spent years trying to laugh off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>In Michael's eyes, everything is a joke.</strong> <strong>Unfortunately, some problems won't laugh with him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/ee5157fc381321c71c41d6705c7601ee.poster.avif?t=1780790509\" width=238 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/ee5157fc381321c71c41d6705c7601ee.webm?t=1780790509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/ee5157fc381321c71c41d6705c7601ee.mp4?t=1780790509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based battles with a twist!</strong> Defend against bullet-hell lite enemy attacks inspired by the <i>UNDERTALE</i> series, and dish out your own baseball themed spells and tactics similar to the <i>Mario &amp; Luigi</i> and <i>Paper Mario</i> series to get the upper hand!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain extra turns</strong> by exploiting enemy weaknesses and strike them out of existence! Three strikes, and they're OUT, taking additional damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize skills</strong> by equipping different pins, allowing you to have a unique set of skills perfect for whatever combat scenario you're in! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character driven story </strong>about an emotionally stunted teenage boy learning to let people in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One entire boy's room to explore!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Inspiration from <i>Earthbound </i></strong>  with themes of <strong>SOMETHING</strong> or <strong>ANOTHER...!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's the worst day of Michael Softwindow's life.</strong> <br><i>He has to touch grass.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/d9627e0612010d0949b46ce90962d957.poster.avif?t=1780790509\" width=238 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/d9627e0612010d0949b46ce90962d957.webm?t=1780790509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/d9627e0612010d0949b46ce90962d957.mp4?t=1780790509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After costing his team last year's championship, Michael Softwindows would rather stay in bed forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, his baseball gear has mysteriously vanished, and finding it means venturing into the strange worlds hidden throughout his room. He gathers his trusty talking baseball bat and goes on a quest to retrieve his friends... <i>If they can even call him a friend.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>underground civilizations</strong>, the world of <strong>forgotten drawings</strong>, <strong>way too big closets</strong>, and his <strong>bad rpg games he made as a kid</strong>...? All in the entirety of his bedroom?! Uncover the history of Michael's past and the tragic events that unfolded that turned him into a rude, cold, irony-poisoned jerk... and if it's too late for redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He would really rather go back to sleep, but he must confront the dastardly <strong>DARK TROPHIOUS</strong> and the mysterious <strong>Coach</strong> to rescue his stolen gear and face the consequences of everything he's spent years trying to laugh off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>In Michael's eyes, everything is a joke.</strong> <strong>Unfortunately, some problems won't laugh with him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/ee5157fc381321c71c41d6705c7601ee.poster.avif?t=1780790509\" width=238 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/ee5157fc381321c71c41d6705c7601ee.webm?t=1780790509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/extras/ee5157fc381321c71c41d6705c7601ee.mp4?t=1780790509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring...</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based battles with a twist!</strong> Defend against bullet-hell lite enemy attacks inspired by the <i>UNDERTALE</i> series, and dish out your own baseball themed spells and tactics similar to the <i>Mario &amp; Luigi</i> and <i>Paper Mario</i> series to get the upper hand!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain extra turns</strong> by exploiting enemy weaknesses and strike them out of existence! Three strikes, and they're OUT, taking additional damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize skills</strong> by equipping different pins, allowing you to have a unique set of skills perfect for whatever combat scenario you're in! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character driven story </strong>about an emotionally stunted teenage boy learning to let people in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One entire boy's room to explore!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Inspiration from <i>Earthbound </i></strong>  with themes of <strong>SOMETHING</strong> or <strong>ANOTHER...!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore forgotten worlds hidden inside memories, drawings, and dreams in a Baseball themed action turn-based RPG where the absurd comedy gives way to a story about grief, friendship, and escaping an irony-poisoned worldview to find the courage to create. Strike back, or STRIKEOUT.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/bd831eecd9438b89925ad2fe4998a342c0832545/header.jpg?t=1780790509", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/6799262b13b2fe3f68a9814d3875405925312788/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780790509", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/6799262b13b2fe3f68a9814d3875405925312788/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780790509", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 9 or up<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 200 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB Ram</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Sunstreak Games"], "publishers": ["Sunstreak Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/d6680fd109ac0d847475ca629b6be112d965ea86/ss_d6680fd109ac0d847475ca629b6be112d965ea86.600x338.jpg?t=1780790509", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2893930/d6680fd109ac0d847475ca629b6be